35
00:00:53,549 --> 00:00:54,607
para pulirlo.

36
00:00:55,495 --> 00:00:57,150
Ahora sí tiene fecha:

37
00:00:57,173 --> 00:00:58,640
sale el 19 de

38
00:00:58,640 --> 00:01:00,620
